1
00:00:00,095 --> 00:00:01,177
One light capsule.

2
00:00:01,953 --> 00:00:03,136
One damaged bridge.

3
00:00:03,906 --> 00:00:05,145
And a whole valley waiting for

4
00:00:05,156 --> 00:00:05,815
sunrise.

5
00:00:06,585 --> 00:00:08,036
Pip found the capsule cooling in

6
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:09,074
an empty workshop.

7
00:00:09,844 --> 00:00:10,647
If it went dark,

8
00:00:10,815 --> 00:00:12,221
every route home would disappear.

9
00:00:13,555 --> 00:00:14,727
He clipped it into his teal

10
00:00:14,738 --> 00:00:15,653
satchel and ran.

11
00:00:16,418 --> 00:00:17,578
The bridge looked safe.

12
00:00:18,348 --> 00:00:19,621
Then a plank rolled under his

13
00:00:19,632 --> 00:00:20,011
foot.

14
00:00:20,781 --> 00:00:22,411
Pip stopped inches from the gap.

15
00:00:23,181 --> 00:00:24,866
Confidence had almost become a very

16
00:00:24,877 --> 00:00:25,926
expensive mistake.

17
00:00:27,255 --> 00:00:29,029
Ada arrived as Pip backed away.

18
00:00:29,805 --> 00:00:30,966
He wanted a shortcut.

19
00:00:31,736 --> 00:00:32,841
She wanted an answer.

20
00:00:33,611 --> 00:00:33,957
What,

21
00:00:34,091 --> 00:00:34,638
exactly,

22
00:00:34,772 --> 00:00:35,363
had failed?

23
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:37,763
They looked past the painted rails

24
00:00:37,774 --> 00:00:39,169
and found the missing connection in

25
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:39,582
the middle.

26
00:00:40,905 --> 00:00:42,478
Pip traced the route: entrance,

27
00:00:42,612 --> 00:00:42,992
span,

28
00:00:43,148 --> 00:00:43,617
exit.

29
00:00:44,393 --> 00:00:45,553
Two parts were sound.

30
00:00:46,335 --> 00:00:47,183
One was not.

31
00:00:47,953 --> 00:00:49,538
Suddenly the problem was smaller than

32
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:50,073
his fear.

33
00:00:50,843 --> 00:00:51,803
They did not need a new

34
00:00:51,814 --> 00:00:52,306
bridge.

35
00:00:53,076 --> 00:00:54,393
They needed the right repair.

36
00:00:55,735 --> 00:00:57,007
They brought three beams from the

37
00:00:57,018 --> 00:00:57,632
workshop.

38
00:00:58,397 --> 00:00:59,702
Ada fixed the anchors.

39
00:01:00,473 --> 00:01:01,533
Pip placed the beams,

40
00:01:01,667 --> 00:01:02,582
one after another.

41
00:01:03,352 --> 00:01:04,769
The path was connected again.

42
00:01:05,551 --> 00:01:07,202
But looking repaired was still different

43
00:01:07,214 --> 00:01:07,961
from being ready.

44
00:01:09,285 --> 00:01:10,869
First came a small test weight.

45
00:01:11,645 --> 00:01:12,683
Then a heavier one.

46
00:01:13,453 --> 00:01:15,061
The repaired span held both.

47
00:01:15,842 --> 00:01:17,360
Pip watched the joints instead of

48
00:01:17,371 --> 00:01:18,040
the finish line,

49
00:01:18,308 --> 00:01:19,770
and finally stepped onto a path

50
00:01:19,782 --> 00:01:20,596
he could explain.

51
00:01:21,925 --> 00:01:22,773
Across the river,

52
00:01:22,929 --> 00:01:23,889
the lighthouse waited.

53
00:01:24,654 --> 00:01:25,881
Pip raised the capsule.

54
00:01:26,663 --> 00:01:27,254
Nothing.

55
00:01:28,024 --> 00:01:29,096
One long second.

56
00:01:29,866 --> 00:01:31,451
Then amber light reached across the

57
00:01:31,462 --> 00:01:31,797
water,

58
00:01:32,154 --> 00:01:33,638
and the dark valley began finding

59
00:01:33,649 --> 00:01:34,386
