60
00:01:35,715 --> 00:01:36,942
Pip looked back at Ada.

61
00:01:37,707 --> 00:01:38,912
The bridge was still the same

62
00:01:38,924 --> 00:01:39,403
bridge.

63
00:01:40,174 --> 00:01:41,111
He was the part that had

64
00:01:41,122 --> 00:01:41,680
changed.

65
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:42,964
Tomorrow,

66
00:01:43,165 --> 00:01:44,727
someone else would need that crossing.

67
00:01:45,508 --> 00:01:46,122
This time,

68
00:01:46,267 --> 00:01:47,294
the light would stay on.
